Why AGPL-3.0 (changed in v1.3.0)
--------------------------------
This project was previously MIT. It moved to AGPL-3.0 so that the Clawd mascot
art could be distributed with it. The art is AGPL-3.0, and combining AGPL work
into a distributed program requires the whole distribution to carry the same
copyleft. Relicensing was the honest way to ship a complete app: every user now
gets the mascot on clone instead of an empty notch.

